## Evidence Collection Framework

### Comprehensive Debug Bundle
```bash
#!/bin/bash
# advanced-exa-debug.sh

BUNDLE="exa-advanced-debug-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)"
mkdir -p "$BUNDLE"/{logs,metrics,network,config,traces}

# 1. Extended logs (1 hour window)
